er(dx: number, dy: number, wheel = 0): void`: Test hook: inject pointer movement / wheel for the next frame.\n2345:- `playAfter(f: InputFrame): void`: Replay, after `beginFrame` (which polled no gamepads): sticks, pointer, wheel, gamepad connection.\n2358:- `delta?: [number, number]`: Pointer movement (CSS pixels) and wheel ticks this frame.\n2359:- `wheel?: number`\n----\n11:5. Physics: `BoxOptions`, `Breakable`, `BreakableOptions`, `Breakables`, `BridgeOptions`, `Built`, `chain`, `ChainOptions`, `CharacterAnim`, `CharacterController`, `CharacterOptions`, `Chunk`, `clothGrid`, `ClothOptions`, `Crumble`, `CrumbleOptions`, `DoorOptions`, `DriveInput`, `explode`, `ExplosionOptions`, `Field`, `fieldAcceleration`, `FieldOptions`, `FIXED_DT`, `FloaterOptions`, `Floaters`, `ForceFields`, `fractureBox`, `FractureOptions`, `hingeDoor`, `InstancedBodies`, `InstancedBodiesOptions`, `InstancedShape`, `KinematicBody`, `Mover`, `MoverOptions`, `moverRotation`, `Movers`, `orbit`, `pathPoint`, `pendulum`, `Physics`, `PhysicsState`, `Ragdoll`, `RagdollOptions`, `RagdollPart`, `Rewind`, `RewindOptions`, `RippleField`, `RippleOptions`, `ropeBridge`, `ropeLine`, `seeded`, `seesaw`, `SeesawOptions`, `softBlob`, `springPad`, `SpringPadOptions`, `Trigger`, `TriggerOptions`, `TriggerShape`, `Vehicle`, `VehicleOptions`, `VerletBody`, `VerletOptions`, `waterHeight`, `WaterWave`, `WAVES_CALM`, `WAVES_CHOPPY`\n13:7. Input and touch: `applyDeadzone`, `ButtonEvent`, `DEFAULT_TOUCH_BUTTONS`, `GAMEPAD_BUTTONS`, `GamepadLike`, `Input`, `InputFrame`, `InputState`, `MOUSE_BUTTONS`, `PRESS_WINDOW`, `TOUCH_KEY`, `TouchButton`, `TouchButtonState`, `TouchControls`, `TouchCorner`\n1421:- `readonly tiles: Crumble[]`\n1428:- `crumble(o: CrumbleOptions): Crumble`: A floor tile that drops shortly after you step on it, and grows back.\n1543:### interface Crumble\n1545:- `readonly o: CrumbleOptions`\n1551:### interface CrumbleOptions\n2268:### GAMEPAD_BUTTONS\n2271:const GAMEPAD_BUTTONS: Readonly<Record<number