mUrl()\n352:### PIXEL_SIZES\n358:### interface PlayerSettings\n372:### QUALITY\n381:### QUALITY_LEVELS\n387:### QUALITY_OPTIONS\n393:### type QualityLevel\n407:### type QualityOption\n413:### interface QualitySettings\n418:### rebindDebugKeys()\n428:### interface Resolution\n446:### RESOLUTIONS\n452:### resolveDebugKeys()\n460:### class Settings\n479:### interface SettingsHost\n492:### class SettingsPanel\n507:### storeSettings()\n513:### urlSettings()\n523:### interface Viewport\n531:### withUrlOptions()\n542:## 2. Camera\n544:### CAMERA_PRESETS\n550:### interface CameraConfig\n566:### type CameraPreset\n577:### class CameraRig\n604:### interface CameraRigState\n617:### createCameraRig()\n623:### class FirstPersonRig\n637:### class FreeRig\n655:### class OrthoRig\n666:### class ThirdPersonRig\n677:## 3. Rendering, looks and filters\n...\n132:### class Engine\n2462:### class AudioManager\n2500:### interface AudioSettings\n2582:### interface Song\n2596:### interface SoundDef\n2634:### interface Voice\n2645:### interface VoiceSettings\n14:8. Audio: `attenuation`, `AudioManager`, `AudioSettings`, `Instrument`, `Listener`, `muffleCutoff`, `noteFrequency`, `parseSong`, `PLAYGROUND_SONG`, `PlayOptions`, `renderSound`, `SFX`, `SfxName`, `Song`, `SoundDef`, `Spatial`, `spatialize`, `SpatialOptions`, `Voice`, `VoiceSettings`, `VolumeChannel`, `Wave`\n299:- `readonly audio: AudioManager`: Sound effects, music, volumes (src/engine/audio).\n361:(sound is the AudioManager's, which keeps its own volumes). A field left out is the game's own\n496:settings.ts; the AudioManager's volumes). The engine pauses the game while it is open. Keys\n685:Every filter's strength: the filtered colour mixed over the input (0 = off, 1 = full).\n694:result is mixed over the input by its `amount`. Unknown ids return the input.\n897:(`FILTER_PRESETS`) as a whole-scene look, then looks that mix layers and stacks.\n1498:- `updateVisual(model: Object3D, dt: number): void`: Per render frame: pick animatio