{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CycNPXKrCMvpZiGWPHTG51","type":"tool_result","content":"875\t### interface Look\n876\t\n877\t- `scene: LookFilter[]`: Filters on the composed frame (both layers).\n878\t- `actors: LayerLook`\n879\t- `environment: LayerLook`\n880\t\n881\t### LOOK_ALIASES\n882\t\n883\t```ts\n884\tconst LOOK_ALIASES: Readonly<Record<string, string>>\n885\t```\n886\t\n887\tNames looks used to have (stored settings, links): `hd_clean` is `no_filters` now.\n888\t\n889\t### LOOK_PRESETS\n890\t\n891\t```ts\n892\tconst LOOK_PRESETS: Readonly<Record<string, Look>>\n893\t```\n894\t\n895\tNamed looks: the default (`none`: pixel art, no filters), `no_filters` (nothing at all:\n896\tfull resolution, no pixel art, no outlines, no filters), every plain filter stack\n897\t(`FILTER_PRESETS`) as a whole-scene look, then looks that mix layers and stacks.\n898\t\n899\t### LOOK_TARGET_LABELS\n900\t\n901\t```ts\n902\tconst LOOK_TARGET_LABELS: Readonly<Record<LookTarget, string>>\n903\t```\n904\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"66624378-a7bb-42a2-8c1d-fc63666b5654","uuid":"1abf0c6d-ab8b-42dd-a741-e3d091110e33","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:24:12.630Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261105-162057__x4c6ec5/work/_research/engine/pixel-engine/API.md","content":"### interface Look\n\n- `scene: LookFilter[]`: Filters on the composed frame (both layers).\n- `actors: LayerLook`\n- `environment: LayerLook`\n\n### LOOK_ALIASES\n\n```ts\nconst LOOK_ALIASES: Readonly<Record<string, string>>\n```\n\nNames looks used to have (stored settings, links): `hd_clean` is `no_filters` now.\n\n### LOOK_PRESETS\n\n```ts\nconst LOOK_PRESETS: Readonly<Record<string, Look>>\n```\n\nNamed looks: the default (`none`: pixel art, no filters), `no_filters` (nothing at all:\nfull resolution, no pixel art, no outlines, no filters), every plain filter stack\n(`FILTER_PRESETS`) as a whole-scene look, then looks that mix layers and stacks.\n\n### LOOK_TARGET_LABELS\n\n```ts\nconst LOOK_TARGET_LABELS: Readonly<Record<LookTarget, string>>\n```\n","numLines":30,"startLine":875,"totalLines":5144}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01CycNPXKrCMvpZiGWPHTG51","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
