{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019TyfNyDovbXu8RuSjmj1Gf","type":"tool_result","content":"3125:### interface ModelDef\n3126-\n3127-- `readonly id: string`\n3128-- `readonly about: string`: One line, searched by `find`.\n3129-- `readonly tags: readonly string[]`\n3130-- `readonly palette: Readonly<Record<Slot, PaletteColor>>`\n3131-- `readonly size?: Vec3`: Declared bounds, checked (10% slack).\n3132-- `readonly params?: Readonly<Record<string, ParamSpec>>`\n3133-- `readonly parts: readonly Part[] | ((p: Readonly<Record<string, number>>, rng: Rng) => readonly Part[])`\n3134-- `readonly anchors?: Readonly<Record<string, Anchor>>`: Oriented ones (`{ at, rot }`) for grips and mounts.\n3135-- `readonly light?: ModelLight`\n3136-- `readonly collider?: 'box' | 'cyl' | 'hull' | 'parts' | 'none'`: Default 'box' (the bounds). 'parts': a box round each part that isn't glow or `collide: false`, for models with openings (an arc\n3137-- `readonly texel?: number`: Texels per metre for `tex` parts, 2–64 (default `DEFAULT_TEXEL` = 8, Gate B's; up to `MOVING_TEXEL` = 20 for a model that moves).\n3138-- `readonly floats?: boolean`: Hangs, mounts on walls or hovers: may sit below or above the floor.\n3139-- `readonly source?: Provenance`\n3140-\n3141-### class ModelError\n3142-\n3143-A model that can't be built; `problems` says why and how to fix each one.\n3144-\n3145-- `new ModelError(id: string, problems: readonly string[])`\n3146-- `readonly id: string`\n3147-- `readonly problems: readonly string[]`\n3148-\n3149-### interface ModelLight\n3150-\n3151-- `readonly at: Vec3`\n3152-- `readonly c: Slot`: A palette slot (a build's override takes `c` or a `color`).\n3153-- `readonly intensity: number`\n1858:### interface RagdollPart\n2703:### interface ParticlePreset\n2721:### type ParticlePresetName\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<titl