 km/h\nreverse speed after 1 s -2.7 manual gears 2 3 4 5 5 5 speed 115\n8-car race finish [skill, time]: [[0.9,\"399.1\"],[0.92,\"400.4\"],[0.95,\"403.6\"],[0.93,\"404.4\"],[0.94,\"407.7\"],[0.98,\"415.7\"],[0.97,\"416.8\"],[0.96,\"460.5\"]] resets 0,0,0,0,0\n10 laps Harbour: lap times 121 117 118 119 121 125 130 134 135 543 wear 0.00 0.00 0.00 0.00 fuel 0.00\nall sim checks fine","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"66624378-a7bb-42a2-8c1d-fc63666b5654","uuid":"12a6cf6e-b5eb-4d19-b2fc-e7e84380f493","timestamp":"2026-11-06T00:11:13.708Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"lengths kestrel 3430, cedar 3216, harbour 2973, saltline 2909, redclay 2209, proving 3020\nSPEC id 0-100 0-200 topspeed brake100\npico      10.5 - 163 45\nkite      7.4 36.1 214 43\nginga     6.6 24.0 243 43\nmoth      6.7 31.2 219 42\nbrandt32  6.1 17.6 278 42\nryu       4.4 17.3 243 41\nlonghorn  6.5 15.9 285 43\nheck      4.8 13.8 301 40\nlibeccio  5.0 12.8 279 40\nkiteCup   5.8 18.6 219 35\nryuRally  4.0 13.1 217 41\nworks     4.4 9.8 289 32\ncorsa     3.8 8.2 299 30\ntype9     3.4 7.0 314 27\nLAPS at 97%: kestrel cedar harbour saltline redclay proving\npico      136 133 150 75 163 128\nkite      125 124 140 64 157 118\nginga     122 120 135 59 146 115\nmoth      123 121 135 61 145 115\nbrandt32  120 118 133 58 145 112\nryu       117 115 127 57 139 110\nlonghorn  121 120 135 58 147 113\nheck      115 113 126 62 137 108\nlibeccio  114 112 126 59 137 106\nkiteCup   110 109 125 54 143 105\nryuRally  116 114 126 58 115 109\nworks     104 102 115 49 142 97\ncorsa     101 99 111 54 137 94\ntype9     92 90 105 41 129 87\nKEYBOARD driver: digital steer through the filter, digital throttle and brake, default assists, 90% pace\n  pico      kestrel  lap 139 resets 0 wall 0\n  kite      cedar    lap 127 resets 0 wall 0\n  ginga     kestrel  lap 126 resets 0 wall 0\n  ryu       harbour  lap 133 resets 0 wall 0\n  longhorn  kestrel  lap 124 resets 0 wall 0\n  heck      cedar    lap 117 reset